From 015e3975ecb589bdd1e6a74f139f52c5f7f467d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 4 May 2026 05:14:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Autofill guest details from room number; clearer PDF
 management UI

- lookupInhouse now falls back to the most recent record for a room when
  no booking date is picked or the date is outside the guest's stay,
  instead of returning no match. Stale-data and out-of-range cases are
  surfaced in the autofill status hint.
- tryAutofill runs as soon as a room number is entered (date no longer
  required) and clears any previously autofilled values when the room
  is cleared or has no PDF record, so unmatched fields stay blank.
- Inhouse modal now shows a "Loaded PDFs" section header with file
  count, a Clear-all action, and a labelled Remove button per row. An
  Add PDFs button is always visible in the modal footer.
